{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] [F] [Cm],        Kya khabar kya pata
[Cm] [F],        kya Khushi hain gham hain kya
[F],        Le ke aansoo jo hansi de
[F],        Gham ke badle jo khushi de
[F] [A#],        Raaj yeh jaana usine
[D#] [F],        Zindagi kya hain zindagi
[F],        Kal Ki baatein Bhul jaa
[F],        Guzre raatein bhul jaa
[A#],        Khwab jo sach ho sake na
[A#] [F],        Unki yaadein bhul jaa
[F],        Jo na haare bebasi se
[F],        Na Kare shikwa kisise
[A#],        raaz ye jaana usine
[D#] [F],        Zindagi kya hain zindagi
[F],        Apane dil kaa dard yeh
[F],        Umarr bhar haskar piye
[A#],        Jeena uska jeena hain jo
[A#] [F],        Auro ki khaatir jiye
[F],        Kaam le zindaadili se
[F],        Yun hi khele zindagi se
[A#],        Raaj yeh jaana usine
[D#] [F],        Zindagi kya hain zindagi
